---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<Layout title="Website Design & Support for Business | HEX Design Labs" description="HEX Design Labs provides small business website design, website refreshes, website support, content updates, and practical website management help.">
	<Hero />
	<main class="home">
		<section class="section text-section text-section-rise">
			<p class="eyebrow">What We Do</p>
			<h2>Website design, website support, and practical management for small businesses that need things handled.</h2>
			<p class="section-intro">
				HEX Design Labs helps small business owners, service providers, and local teams shape websites that are easier to understand, easier to update, and more useful for everyday customer questions. The focus is simple: clear pages, straightforward calls to action, flexible support, and a website that feels aligned with the business behind it.
			</p>

			<div class="cards">
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Website Design</h3>
					<p>Clean, modern small business website design for companies that need a professional online presence, clear service information, and a structure that supports future updates.</p>
					<a href="/services" class="card-link">Explore website design services</a>
				</article>

				<article class="card">
					<h3>Website Management</h3>
					<p>Ongoing website support for owners who need help with content updates, small page changes, routine site care, and practical improvements over time.</p>
					<a href="/services" class="card-link">Review website management options</a>
				</article>

				<article class="card">
					<h3>Marketing Support</h3>
					<p>Design and content support for service pages, landing pages, website copy cleanup, promotional graphics, and customer-facing materials that need to feel consistent.</p>
					<a href="/services" class="card-link">See content support services</a>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="highlight text-section text-section-slide-left">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">Website Management</p>
				<h2>Your website should not become another thing you have to babysit.</h2>
				<p>
					Many small business websites start strong and then slowly become outdated, confusing, or hard to keep current. HEX provides website help for businesses that need a steady partner for updates, maintenance, page improvements, and support after launch, without turning every small change into a separate project.
				</p>
			</div>

			<a href="/services" class="button primary">View website support services</a>
		</section>

		<section class="section two-column text-section text-section-slide-right">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">Website Help</p>
				<h2>A clearer website can make everyday business conversations easier.</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="copy-stack">
				<p>
					A small business website often has to answer the same questions a front desk, sales call, or referral conversation would answer: what you do, who you help, where you work, how to get in touch, and what someone should expect next. When those details are scattered or outdated, visitors can leave with more questions than confidence.
				</p>
				<p>
					HEX helps organize website content around those practical needs. That may include clearer page headings, stronger service descriptions, easier contact paths, better internal links, refreshed visuals, or routine content updates. The goal is not to overcomplicate the site. The goal is to make it more useful for the people who are already looking for help.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="section text-section text-section-rise">
			<p class="eyebrow">Who We Help</p>
			<h2>Built for practical businesses that need clear, credible websites.</h2>
			<p class="section-intro">
				Whether the need is a new business website, a website refresh, a clearer services page, or ongoing website management, the work is shaped around how real customers look for information. That might mean cleaner navigation, stronger service descriptions, better contact paths, or content that explains what the business does without making visitors dig.
			</p>

			<div class="pill-grid">
				<span>Small Businesses</span>
				<span>Law Firms</span>
				<span>Construction</span>
				<span>MSPs</span>
				<span>Daycares</span>
				<span>Manufacturing</span>
				<span>Service Businesses</span>
				<span>IT Companies</span>
				<span>Fire Safety</span>
				<span>Software Developers</span>
				<span>Counseling Services</span>
				<span>Wellness Groups</span>
				<span>Music Industry</span>
				<span>Landscapers</span>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="section two-column text-section text-section-slide-left">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">Ongoing Care</p>
				<h2>Website support does not have to mean starting over every time.</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="copy-stack">
				<p>
					Some businesses need a full website design project, but many simply need steady website support. Updating a service page, revising staff information, replacing old images, adjusting a call to action, or adding a new landing page can help the site stay closer to the current business.
				</p>
				<p>
					HEX can help with those practical website management needs as they come up. The work stays flexible, so the site can be improved in sensible steps instead of waiting until everything feels overdue.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="cta">
			<h2>Need help with your website?</h2>
			<p>Share what feels outdated, unclear, unfinished, or hard to manage. HEX can help sort through the next practical step and whether a website refresh, new page, or ongoing support makes sense.</p>
			<a href="/contact" class="button primary">Request website help</a>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap');
.home {
	max-width: 1120px;
	margin: 0 auto;
	padding: 72px 24px;
	color: var(--color-text);
	font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;

	}

	.eyebrow {
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.8rem);
		line-height: 1.06;
		margin: 0 0 24px;
		letter-spacing: -0.06em;
		color: var(--color-text)
		
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
		line-height: 1;
		margin: 0 0 20px;
		letter-spacing: -0.045em;
		color: var(--color-text)
	}

	h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		margin: 0 0 12px;
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	p {
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--color-body);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.section-intro {
		max-width: 780px;
		margin-top: 18px;
	}

	.hero-text {
		font-size: 1.18rem;
		max-width: 680px;
	}

	.hero {
		margin-bottom: 40px;
	}

	.hero-buttons {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 14px;
		margin-top: 32px;
	}

	.button {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 14px 22px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 700;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
		border: none;
		outline: none;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-button);
	}

	.button:focus,
	.button:focus-visible {
		outline: none;
	}

	a:not(.button) {
		color: #54B8ED;
		font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
	}

	a:not(.button):hover {
		color: #DC4F41;
	}

	.button:hover {
		transform: translate(3px, 3px);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-button-hover);
		background: var(--color-on-surface-light);
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.primary {
		background: var(--color-primary);
		color: var(--color-on-surface-light);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-button);
	}

	.secondary {
		background: var(--color-on-surface-light);
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.section {
		padding: 72px 0;
		border-top: 0;
	}

	.home > .section:first-child {
		border-top: 0;
	}

	.cards {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 20px;
		margin-top: 36px;
	}

	.card {
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 0;
		border-radius: 24px;
		padding: 28px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 16px;
		color: var(--color-text);
		text-align: left;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: background 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
	}

	.cards .card:nth-child(1) {
		background: var(--color-surface);
	}

	.cards .card:nth-child(2) {
		background: var(--color-strong);
	}

	.cards .card:nth-child(3) {
		background: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.card p {
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.card-link {
		color: var(--color-text);
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.card .card-link {
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.two-column {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
		gap: 40px;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.copy-stack {
		display: grid;
		gap: 18px;
	}

	.highlight {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 32px;
		background: var(--color-strong);
		border-radius: 32px;
		padding: 44px;
		margin: 32px 0;
	}

	.highlight .eyebrow,
	.highlight h2,
	.highlight p {
		color: var(--color-on-surface-light);
	}

	.pill-grid {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-top: 32px;
	}

	.pill-grid span {
		--pill-color: var(--color-surface);
		--pill-stagger: 0%;
		background: transparent;
		border: 2px solid var(--pill-color);
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 10px 16px;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--pill-color);
		animation: pill-slide-in both;
		animation-timeline: view();
		animation-range: entry calc(4% + var(--pill-stagger)) cover calc(38% + var(--pill-stagger));
	}

	.pill-grid span:nth-child(3n + 2) {
		--pill-stagger: 4%;
	}

	.pill-grid span:nth-child(3n) {
		--pill-stagger: 8%;
	}

	@keyframes pill-slide-in {
		from {
			opacity: 0;
			transform: translateX(-44px);
		}

		to {
			opacity: 1;
			transform: translateX(0);
		}
	}

	.cta {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		text-align: center;
		background: var(--color-strong);
		color: var(--color-on-surface-light);
		border: 0;
		border-radius: 36px;
		min-height: 380px;
		padding: 96px 32px;
		margin-top: 56px;
	}

	.cta h2 {
		color: var(--color-on-surface-light);
		max-width: 760px;
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
	}

	.cta p {
		color: var(--color-on-muted);
		max-width: 760px;
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
		margin-bottom: 28px;
	}

	.cta .primary {
		background: var(--color-on-surface-light);
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.cta .primary:hover {
		background: var(--color-primary);
		color: var(--color-on-surface-light);
	}

	@media (max-width: 800px) {
		.cards,
		.two-column,
		.highlight {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.home {
			padding: 40px 18px;
		}

		.hero {
			padding: 48px 0 64px;
		}
	}
</style>
